# Mirrors tetriSH/auth/.gitignore. Everything here is per-checkout except the
# CA the client verifies against and the script that mints a key pair.
#
# The private key, the signed certificate and the CSR were tracked until
# 2026-09-14. They still exist in history - see the note in the root README.
*
!.gitignore
!cacsertificate.crt
!generate_keys.sh
